        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Shahana's daughter Dipa asks her tailor to stitch deep pockets on her burkha. The young waiter at the tea stall worships the ground she walks on; the maid at home revels in her affection; the widowed college teacher's heart is in turmoil. Yet her family considers her a disgrace and a menace to society.",
          "runtime": 126,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "A House Named Shahana"
        }
